---
// Inline Mid-Page Conversion CTA Banner Component
---

<section class="py-8 bg-surface-dark text-white border-y border-surface-border relative overflow-hidden" aria-label="Quick Conversion Banner">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-center md:text-left">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
          Ready to Start Your SAP Journey in Mumbai?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium mt-0.5">
          Get free counseling, fee structure, and batch schedule in 30 mins.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="shrink-0">
        <a
          href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1T9MaTI0fQnimVQVLGYunn7XoaZK29Uf19RpTTjFI8gg/viewform?pli=1&pli=1&edit_requested=true"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-[46px] px-7 py-3 text-sm sm:text-base font-black text-white bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover active:bg-primary rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-primary/30 transition-all transform hover:scale-105"
        >
          Check My Eligibility →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
